ignatedPerson><in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement5">2026-05-23</in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange><in-capmkt:BriefProfile contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement5">Shri Asheesh Chaturvedi has been serving as Finance Controller of the Company since October 2021. Prior to joining us, he was Finance Controller at Reliance Commercial Finance Limited for over three years. His career also includes a distinguished 17-year tenure as Senior Audit Manager at Pathak H.D. &amp; Associates and Chaturvedi &amp; Shah, Chartered Accountants.

